@host = http://localhost:5090
@token = paste-a-CompanyAdmin-access-token

### Health (no token)
GET {{host}}/health

### US-E5-1: requests queued for an order (CompanyAdmin token)
GET {{host}}/api/notification-requests?orderReference=ORD-260925-XXXXXX
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One request with its recipients
GET {{host}}/api/notification-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
